while (true) {
    // Scan for enemies
    foreach (Enemy enemy in enemies) {
        // Detect enemy
        if (enemy.IsDetected()) {
            // Respond to enemy
            SendPowerUps(enemy);
        }
    }
    // Resolve threats
    ResolveThreats();
}
```
This analogy simplifies the complex processes of the human immune system, but it should give you a basic understanding of how it works!

